### Update Algorithm (Pseudo)
1) `dt = clamp(dt, 0, MAX_DT)`
2) If running:
   - update state variables
   - compute derived outputs
   - push chart sample (respect sampling policy + cap)
3) draw stage (canvas/three)
4) update React UI state at UI_HZ (do NOT set state every frame)

